#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of Python 2"
msgstr "Instalação do Python 2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:130
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"First, disable the installation of a script that overwrites a more recent "
"script:"
msgstr ""
"Primeiro, desabilite a instalação de um conjunto sequencial de comandos que "
"sobrescreve um conjunto sequencial de comandos mais recente:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:134
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>sed -i '/2to3/d' ./setup.py</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>sed -i '/2to3/d' ./setup.py</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>Python 2</application> by running the following "
"commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>Python 2</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:141
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../Python-&python2-version;-security_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                              \\\n"
"            --enable-shared                            \\\n"
"            --with-system-expat                        \\\n"
"            --with-system-ffi                          \\\n"
"            --enable-unicode=ucs4                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>patch -Np1 -i ../Python-&python2-version;-security_fixes-1.patch &amp;&amp;\n"
"./configure --prefix=/usr                             \\\n"
"            --enable-shared                            \\\n"
"            --with-system-expat                        \\\n"
"            --with-system-ffi                          \\\n"
"            --enable-unicode=ucs4                     &amp;&amp;\n"
"make</userinput>"

#.  https://bugs.python.org/issue46811
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:150
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you invoke the tests, they will run through twice.  To test the results, "
"issue: <command>make -k test</command>.  Several tests are known to fail, "
"including <literal>test_ftplib</literal>, <literal>test_ssl</literal>, "
"<literal>test_urllib2_localnet</literal>, <literal>test_xml_etree</literal>,"
" <literal>test_xml_etree_c</literal>, and <literal>test_minidom</literal>. "
"These failures are due to OpenSSL-3 and Expat-2.4.6."
msgstr ""
"Se você invocar os testes, [então] eles executarão duas vezes. Para testar "
"os resultados, emita: &quot;<command>make -k test</command>&quot;. Vários "
"testes são conhecidos por falharem, incluindo "
"&quot;<literal>test_ftplib</literal>&quot;, "
"&quot;<literal>test_ssl</literal>&quot;, "
"&quot;<literal>test_urllib2_localnet</literal>&quot;, "
"&quot;<literal>test_xml_etree</literal>&quot;, "
"&quot;<literal>test_xml_etree_c</literal>&quot; e "
"&quot;<literal>test_minidom</literal>&quot;. Essas falhas são devidas ao "
"&quot;OpenSSL-3&quot; e ao &quot;Expat-2.4.6&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:164
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr "Agora, como o(a) usante <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:167
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>make altinstall                                &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -s python2.7        /usr/bin/python2        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -s python2.7-config /usr/bin/python2-config &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod -v 755 /usr/lib/libpython&python2-majorver;.so.1.0</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>make altinstall                               &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -s python2.7        /usr/bin/python2        &amp;&amp;\n"
"ln -s python2.7-config /usr/bin/python2-config &amp;&amp;\n"
"chmod -v 755 /usr/lib/libpython&python2-majorver;.so.1.0</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:173
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Since <application>Python 2</application> is in maintenance mode, and "
"<application>Python 3</application> is recommended by upstream for "
"development, you probably do not need to install the documentation.  "
"However, if you still want to install documentation for both "
"<application>Python</application> versions, be sure to define the "
"<envar>PYTHONDOCS</envar> variable for the version you want to use, each "
"time you need to consult the documentation. If you have downloaded the "
"preformatted documentation from <ulink "
"url=\"https://docs.python.org/download.html\"/>, install it as the "
"<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Como o &quot;<application>Python 2</application>&quot; está em modo de "
"manutenção e o &quot;<application>Python 3</application>&quot; é recomendado"
" pelo(a) produtor(a) para desenvolvimento, você provavelmente não precisa "
"instalar a documentação. No entanto, se você ainda quiser instalar a "
"documentação para ambas as versões do "
"&quot;<application>Python</application>&quot;, [então] certifique-se de "
"definir a variável &quot;<envar>PYTHONDOCS</envar>&quot; para a versão que "
"deseja usar, cada vez que precisar consultar a documentação. Se você baixou "
"a documentação pré-formatada a partir de <ulink "
"url=\"https://docs.python.org/download.html\"/>, [então] instale-a como o(a)"
" usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:185
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"tar --strip-components=1                     \\\n"
"    --no-same-owner                          \\\n"
"    --directory /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; \\\n"
"    -xvf ../python-&python2-version;-docs-html.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; -type d -exec chmod 0755 {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; -type f -exec chmod 0644 {} \\;</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>install -v -dm755 /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"tar --strip-components=1                    \\\n"
"    --no-same-owner                          \\\n"
"    --directory /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; \\\n"
"    -xvf ../python-&python2-version;-docs-html.tar.bz2 &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; -type d -exec chmod 0755 {} \\; &amp;&amp;\n"
"find /usr/share/doc/python-&python2-version; -type f -exec chmod 0644 {} \\;</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:197
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:200
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-expat</parameter>: This switch enables linking "
"against system version of <application>Expat</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-expat</parameter>: Essa chave habilita vincular à "
"versão do sistema do &quot;<application>Expat</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:205
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--with-system-ffi</parameter>: This switch enables linking "
"against system version of <application>libffi</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--with-system-ffi</parameter>: Essa chave habilita vincular à "
"versão do sistema da &quot;<application>libffi</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:210
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--enable-unicode=ucs4</parameter>: This switch enables 32-bit "
"Unicode support in <application>Python</application>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--enable-unicode=ucs4</parameter>: Essa chave habilita o suporte "
"&quot;Unicode&quot; de 32 bits no "
"&quot;<application>Python</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:215
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-ensurepip=yes</option> : This switch enables building "
"<command>pip</command> and <command>setuptools</command> packaging programs."
"  <command>setuptools</command> is needed for building some Python modules."
"  This switch is not recommended because this version of Python is no longer"
" maintained."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-ensurepip=yes</option> : Essa chave habilita construir os "
"aplicativos de empacotamento &quot;<command>pip</command>&quot; e "
"&quot;<command>setuptools</command>&quot;. "
"&quot;<command>setuptools</command>&quot; é necessário para construir alguns"
" módulos &quot;Python&quot;. Essa chave não é recomendada porque essa versão"
" do &quot;Python&quot; não mais é mantida."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:223
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>--with-dbmliborder=bdb:gdbm:ndbm</option>: Use this switch if you "
"want to build <application>Python</application> DBM Module against "
"<application>Berkeley DB</application> instead of "
"<application>GDBM</application>."
msgstr ""
"<option>--with-dbmliborder=bdb:gdbm:ndbm</option>: Use essa chave se você "
"desejar construir o módulo &quot;DBM&quot; do "
"&quot;<application>Python</application>&quot; contra "
"&quot;<application>Berkeley DB</application>&quot; em vez do "
"&quot;<application>GDBM</application>&quot;."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:230
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>make altinstall</command>: This make target omits some default "
"symbolic links that may interfere with Python 3."
msgstr ""
"<command>make altinstall</command>: Esse alvo do &quot;make&quot; omite "
"alguns links simbólicos padrão que possivelmente interfiram no "
"&quot;Python&quot; 3."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:235
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>chmod ...</command>: Fix permissions for libraries to be consistent"
" with other libraries."
msgstr ""
"<command>chmod ...</command>: Corrige permissões para bibliotecas serem "
"consistentes com outras bibliotecas."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid "Configuring Python 2"
msgstr "Configurando o Python 2"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/general/prog/python2.xml:245
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"In order for <command>python</command> to find the installed documentation, "
